      "v": 17,
      "zh": "若有人在基督里，他就是新造的人，旧事已过，都变成新的了。",
      "en": "So then, if anyone is in Christ, he is a new creation; what is old has passed away[NOTE:1]—look, what is new[NOTE:2] has come![NOTE:3]",
